{
  "_doc": "T3763: supervised long-running loops (tools.agents.loops). alive: module:function(root) owned by the loop's module; module+args or start: how to restart; restart false = HEALTH only; stopped: module:function(root), True while the loop's own kill switch is set (no restart); switch: module:function(root) -> Path of that kill switch, set and cleared by a stale-code restart (T3830, tools.agents.loop_code; without one the supervisor writes tmp/loops/<key>.restart.json, honoured by loops.tick); restart_wait_s: how long a graceful stop may take (default max_silence_s). T3777: any supervisor in any container restarts a dead loop (liveness is the loop's flock). docs/decisions/robust-tooling.md",
